
<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8" />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Muli" rel="stylesheet">
<title>Oups petit problème technique - vertbaudet</title>
<style type="text/css">

    body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
    }

    * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        -moz-box-sizing: border-box;
        -webkit-box-sizing: border-box;
        font-family: 'Muli', sans-serif;
        color: #2D2A29;
    }

    .main a.button{
        text-align: center;
        margin: 0 auto;
        font-size: 14px;
        text-decoration: none;
        line-height: 14px;
        background-color: #2D2A29;
        border: #2D2A29 solid 2px;
        color: #ffffff;
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 15px 30px;
        margin-top: 25px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: color 200ms ease-in, background 200ms ease-in;
    }
    .main a.button:hover {
        color: #2D2A29;
        background-color: #ffffff;
    }

    .fail-container {
        max-width: 1220px;
        margin: auto;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: row;
        gap: 40px;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
    }
    .vb-logo {
        width: 260px;
        height: 80px;
        display: block;
        margin: auto;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
        margin-top: 60px;
        background: url(https://media.vertbaudet.fr/NoSynchronized/Banners/3-0-0/404/logovertbaudet.png) no-repeat center center;
        background-size: contain;
    }
    .right,
    .left {
        width: 50%;
        height: fit-content;
        position: relative;
    }
    .vb-gif {
        width: 100%;
        height: 300px;
        background: url(https://media.vertbaudet.fr/NoSynchronized/Banners/3-0-0/404/fail_404.gif) no-repeat center center;
        background-size: contain;
        display: block;
        z-index: 2;
        position: relative;
    }
    .vb-gif-fix {
        width: 100%;
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        height: 300px;
        background: url(https://media.vertbaudet.fr/NoSynchronized/Banners/3-0-0/404/fail_404_fix.png) no-repeat center center;
        background-size: contain;
        display: block;
        z-index: 1;
    }
    .houston {
        font-size: 40px;
        font-weight: 600;
    }
    .text {
        font-size: 24px;
    }

    @media only screen and (max-width:1300px)
    {
        .main {
            padding: 0 40px;
        }
    }
    
    @media only screen and (max-width:1080px)
    {
        .main {
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
    }

    @media only screen and (max-width:768px)
    {
        .houston {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .text {
            font-size: 18px;
        }
    }

    @media only screen and (max-width:640px)
    {
        .fail-container {
           flex-direction: column;
           gap: 20px;
        }

        .vb-logo {
            width: 150px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .left,
        .right {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 400px;
        }
        .houston {
            font-size: 28px;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .text {
            font-size: 16px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .main a.button{ 
            display: block;
            margin: auto;
            width: fit-content;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }
    }
    
    @media only screen and (max-width:480px)
    {
        .main {
            padding: 0 10px;
        }

        .vb-gif-fix,
        .vb-gif {
            height: 200px;
        }
    }
</style>
</head>

<body>
	<div class="main">
        <span class="vb-logo"></span>
        <div class="fail-container">
            <div class="left">
                <span class="vb-gif-fix"></span>
                <span class="vb-gif"></span>
            </div>
            <div class="right">
                <p class="houston">Houston&nbsp;!</p>
                <p class="text">Vous venez d’atterrir sur une page introuvable. On vous retrouve tout de suite à l’accueil, vous nous recevez&nbsp;?</p>
                <a class="button" href="https://www.vertbaudet.fr/">
                    Je retourne à l'accueil
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
	</div>
</body>
</html>